{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.14]Enviyon on the mix\n[00:02.44]So\n[00:02.50]I'm— I'm boolin' in the cut and shit\n[00:03.80]This— this little bitch walk up to me and she say—\n[00:06.10]She say, \"What's so special about you?\" and shit\n[00:08.08]She was with her little nigga and shit, I was trying to— You feel me?\n[00:10.56]But I told her, huh\n[00:12.30]My kush too strong, bae\n[00:13.84]My money too long, bae\n[00:15.18]I stand too tall, bae\n[00:16.82]I ball, John Wall, bae\n[00:18.24]Ya nigga too small, bae\n[00:19.70]He ain't got no sauce, bae\n[00:20.50]But most of all baby, huh, yeah\n[Chorus]\n[00:21.48]I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah (Yeah)\n[00:23.10]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:30.72]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:33.24]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah\n[00:36.56]I've been makin' moves (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:38.68]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah\n[00:42.80]I've been makin' moves (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:46.16]Yeah, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah, yeah\n[Verse 1]\n[00:49.66]Hold up, wait a minute\n[00:50.52]Let me get my cup and pour me up a double, uh (Hold on)\n[00:52.86]Ballin' on these niggas\n[00:53.64]Fuck around and I'ma get a triple double (Woah)\n[00:55.86]I've been flexin' on my exes\n[00:56.94]I don't really have to move a muscle (Flex)\n[00:58.98]If you wanna be a dummy, run up on 'em, bake 'em like a oven (Grrah)\n[01:02.14]I just want a Lamborghini pull up seats, same color candy (Skrrt)\n[01:05.24]I just wanna fuck her, bust a nut, and leave puddle in her panties (Eek)\n[01:08.28]I just wanna buy my mom a house and get a Grammy for my granny (Rich)\n[01:11.38]I just wanna catch a fuck nigga with the semi-automatic (Grrah, grrah)\n[01:14.36]He— he don't really want the ratchet (Woo)\n[01:16.02]If he want it, he can have it (Boy)\n[01:17.58]I don't fuck with under average (Yeah)\n[01:19.06]Bitch, you gotta be the baddest (Yeah)\n[01:20.60]Fuckin' hoes in designer clothes just became another bad habit (Rich, rich)\n[01:23.76]I know niggas still in the kitchen whippin', wrappin' dope up in plastic (Yeah)\n[01:26.88]I know they gon' get the message (Huh)\n[01:28.36]They know ballin' is a habit (Uh-huh)\n[01:29.96]If you want it, then we got it (Yeah)\n[01:31.50]Always keep the tool on me, tool on me\n[01:32.96]I could never leave without it (No)\n[01:34.64]And you know I got my girl with me\n[01:35.86]I could never ever leave without her, no\n[01:37.24]I can never leave without her, no\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[01:38.02]I'm makin' moves, yeah, I be makin' moves, uh\n[01:39.06]I'm makin' moves, yeah, I be makin' moves, uh\n[01:41.40]I'm makin' moves, yeah, I be makin' moves, uh\n[01:44.08]You know that we makin' these moves, moves, moves\n[Chorus]\n[01:47.14]I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah (Yeah)\n[01:49.10]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:54.42]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah (Yeah, yeah)\n[02:00.50]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah\n[02:03.14]I've been makin' moves (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:06.68]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah\n[02:09.46]I've been makin' moves (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:12.88]Yeah, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah, yeah\n[Verse 2]\n[02:15.94]Bitch, I been trapping like Gotti (Trap), I wanna jump in a Audi (Skrrt)\n[02:19.08]I wanna fuck on a thottie (Ew), I wanna shoot up a party (Grrah)\n[02:22.26]I wanna fuck on your baby mama\n[02:23.44]If she leave witth me, nigga, I'm sorry (Sike)\n[02:25.28]I wanna fuck on a supermodel when she tatted all up on her body (Go, go, go)\n[02:28.42]I'm finna cop me a draco (Grrah), but fuck all the hype shit (Fuck all the hype shit)\n[02:31.42]Yeah, I wanna cop me a draco (Grrah), I'm not with the fight shit (Yeah)\n[02:34.42]We rollin' up good gas, good gas, I call it that nitrous (I call it that nitrous)\n[02:37.52]She give me that FaceTime, FaceTime, don't got a wife shit (I don't gotta skrrt shit)\n[02:40.68]I pull up, I'm stuntin', I'm fuckin' that bitch in the back of my Wraith (In the back of my Wraith)\n[02:43.86]I told her to suck it until I start bustin' right all in her face (Bustin' right all in her face)\n[02:46.76]You know a young nigga gettin' right to the cake (Rich)\n[02:49.06]I'm only tryin' to fuck you, I'm cutting right to the chase, ayy (Go, go)\n[Chorus]\n[02:50.84]I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah (Yeah)\n[02:52.30]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah (Yeah, yeah)\n[02:56.26]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah (Yeah, yeah)\n[02:59.44]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah\n[03:06.02]I've been makin' moves (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[03:08.62]Huh, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah\n[03:11.08]I've been makin' moves (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[03:14.82]Yeah, I make moves, moves, moves, moves, moves, yeah, yeah\n[Outro]\n[03:18.12]Haha, you know how we fuckin' move, man\n[03:21.42]We stay makin' moves type shit, you feel me?\n[03:23.88]Stay makin' moves\n[03:24.78]I make moves, moves, moves, yeah, yeah\n[03:30.38]I make moves, I make moves\n[03:33.20]Fuck nigga","words":[[1.14,1.32,"Enviyon"],[1.36,1.38,"on"],[1.42,2.32,"the"],[2.36,2.4,"mix"],[2.44,2.46,"So"],[2.5,2.56,"I'm—"],[2.6,2.66,"I'm"],[2.74,2.94,"boolin'"],[2.98,3.0,"in"],[3.08,3.14,"the"],[3.24,3.4,"cut"],[3.46,3.52,"and"],[3.58,3.76,"shit"],[3.8,4.0,"This—"],[4.06,4.2,"this"],[4.28,4.44,"little"],[4.5,4.64,"bitch"],[4.68,4.8,"walk"],[4.86,4.88,"up"],[4.94,5.02,"to"],[5.08,5.1,"me"],[5.14,5.18,"and"],[5.22,5.26,"she"],[5.34,5.48,"say—"],[6.1,6.16,"She"],[6.24,6.34,"say,"],[6.4,6.56,"\"What's"],[6.6,6.62,"so"],[6.74,7.06,"special"],[7.1,7.36,"about"],[7.4,7.52,"you?\""],[7.68,7.72,"and"],[7.8,7.94,"shit"],[8.08,8.18,"She"],[8.22,8.3,"was"],[8.36,8.44,"with"],[8.5,8.56,"her"],[8.62,8.76,"litt